 228               /       FIO FUNCTION.
 229               
 230 001142  4453  XIO,    JMS I   INTEGER         /GET LOW-ORDER FROM FIXED FLAC
 231 001143  7700          SMA CLA                 /SKIP IF INPUT REQUESTED
 232 001144  5350          JMP     XOUT            /JUMP IF OUTPUT REQUESTED
 233 001145  4464          JMS I   INDEV           /GET A CHARACTER
