 235               /       AC WILL BE NON-ZERO IF FIO(NEGATIVE), ZERO IF FDIS(XX).
 236               
 237               /       FDIS FUNCTION ENTERS HERE WITH CLEAR AC.
 238               
 239 001146  6242  XDIS,   CIF     DFIELD          /GOTO CODE FIELD
 240 001147  5103          JMP     XIOMORE         /CONTINUE THERE
 241               
 242               /       COMES HERE IF FIO(POSITIVE).
 243               
 244 001150  1046  XOUT,   TAD     FLAC+2          /GET LOW-ORDER AGAIN
 245 001151  4463          JMS I   OUTDEV          /OUTPUT IT
 246 001152  5536  XRET,   RETURN
 247               
