 423               /       AC CONTAINS POTENTIAL "C" BIT FROM SOFTWARE CORE-SIZE WORD.
 424               
 425 040200  7650  BONCE2, SNA CLA                 /SKIP IF "C" BIT SET
 426 040201  5254  ILPTR,  JMP     NOCONSOLE       /JUMP IF NOT SET
